{"id":"n57558-1-8","stage":3,"title":"바위 · 岩石","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57558-1-8-1","ko":"저 더 이상 못 걷겠어요. 잠시 쉬었다 가요.","zh":"我实在走不动了。我们先休息一会儿再继续吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"이상","meaning":"既然","explanation":"이상：既然","readings":[{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66580","senseId":"3","lemma":"이상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이상","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"걷겠어요.","meaning":"走，行走，步行","explanation":"걷다：走，行走，步行；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"걷다","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29667","senseId":"1","lemma":"걷다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걷겠어요","audio":"/audio/fb458c7bfcfe00c54d50.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬었다","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬었다","audio":"/audio/16f506d9f9abe67a8807.mp3"}},{"text":"가요.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"e6e77b83100b28e7","term":"이상","zh":"既然","audio":"/audio/e6e77b83100b28e797f1.mp3","entryId":"66580","definition":"已经这样的话。","pronunciation":["이ː상"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"82e3bb1b27351e4d","term":"걷다","zh":"走，行走，步行","audio":"/audio/82e3bb1b27351e4d45ed.mp3","entryId":"29667","definition":"在地上交替着抬起并移动脚，改换位置。","pronunciation":["걷ː따"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"片刻，暂时","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"71203","definition":"一小会儿。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3cbfccd5d91c6f61cffc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57558-1-8-2","ko":"그래요. 저 바위 위에 앉아 잠시 쉬도록 해요.","zh":"好的。那我们就坐在那块石头上休息一会儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래요","audio":"/audio/b6894238d8eae709ebfd.mp3"}},{"text":"저","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"바위","meaning":"岩石","explanation":"바위：岩石","readings":[{"term":"바위","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57558","senseId":"1","lemma":"바위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바위","audio":"/audio/e51e6c52f2963665e990.mp3"}},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"위에","audio":"/audio/045b71d3898d7969a90d.mp3"}},{"text":"앉아","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉아","audio":"/audio/709a1afa79c56d9a698a.mp3"}},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"片刻，暂时","explanation":"잠시：片刻，暂时","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71203","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":